3% (carving without the corridor). Camera 1.28 to 1.40 m above floor, which supports metres but doesn't prove them | 32 s carving | Under 40 GB RAM, not measured | Roihu CPU |\n| 2026-11-07 | Viktor | Routes to pump and motor candidates | Own splat, `lift_v2` | 0.6 m wide | All 30 reachable. Checked by eye: real pumps include `obj-0048` and its twin, and the red circulator `obj-0049`; many Qwen pump labels are wrong | Under 1 s per route | | Roihu CPU |\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\np='handoffs/viktortrilar.md'\nopen(p,'w').write('''# viktortrilar: viktor/viewer-objects (draft PR #3)\n**Goal:** demo on own splat: real objects, floor, routes, P-005\n**Done:** app/nav/carve.py removes floaters using rendered views; grid.py takes `--views` and `--walked`; scripts/camera_path.py exports the camera path; routes return `view_from` (2 m back). P-005 candidate is obj-0048 with `manual_visual_unconfirmed`, confidence 0.3\n**Verified:** lint passes; 99 tests passed, 2 skipped (no torch). Real grid: 6.6 m2 connected at 0.6 m (was 0.2). 7 rendered views along the route look clear, by eye. /api/route tested locally on the real grid and assets\n**Roihu:** `data/scene/splat_v2/{clean.ply,light_full.ply,nav_grid_carved.npz,walked.npy}`, `runs/lift_v2`, `runs/floor_v2`. Local overrides: scratchpad `overrides_v2.json`. Cert valid to 2026-11-07 20:41\n**Next:** a person confirms P-005 and which of the two pumps. Publish a `scene-v2` Release if Viktor agrees. Viewer doesn't draw routes yet (Benjamin's area). Decide on Eduard's PR #2, which duplicates A*. Redo the AI label review for the new scene\n**Blockers:** none. Open: whether scene units are truly metres; object labels are mostly `unsure`/`unknown` on the new scene\n''')\nEOF\ngit add -A app scripts/camera_path.py tests docs/RESULTS.md handoffs/viktortrilar.md; git status --short | head -12; git commit -qm \"Remove floaters from the floor map and add a viewing point to routes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q git@github.com:Sairanyx/Newbies.git viktor/viewer-objects 2>&1 | tail -1; git log --oneline -1","description":"Check the API on all profiles, record results, then commit and push","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2682,"cache_read_input_tokens":134164,"output_tokens":1883,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":25},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2682,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1883,"cache_read_input_tokens":134164,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2682,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2682},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":15925,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01GpEXnz76J5SYxrjFuzpBUo":{"command":"cd /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; S=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad; python3 - \"$S/api_check.py\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys; p=sys.argv[1]; t=open(p).read().split('r=c.post')[0]\nt+='''for prof in (\"person\",\"robot\",\"carrying\"):\n    r=c.post(\"/api/route\",json={\"start\":start,\"object_id\":\"obj-0048\",\"profile\":prof}); d=r.json(); print(prof,r.status_code,{k:(v if k!=\"path\" else len(v)) for k,v in d.items()} if r.status_code==200 else d)\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(t)\nEOF\nPYTHONPATH=. uv run --no-sync --with numpy --with scipy --with fastapi --with httpx python \"$S/api_check.py\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"VIRTUAL\\|Deprecation\\|noqa\\|Installed\" | tail -6 | cut -c1-420\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/RESULTS.md'; t=open(p).read()\nt=t.replace(\"| Floor area connected | Not run | Not run |\",\"| Flo