{"parentUuid":"b61018e4-303c-4bad-84ce-194a381dc97c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2dd59bae-974d-4989-9fc1-a419cc3377d5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SyYVtQNHJNahot1zVEider","type":"tool_result","content":"VIEWS_TAG ?= views-v1\nVIEWS_FILE ?= equipment_room_views_v1.tar\n\n.PHONY: setup entire views gpu train tb web fmt lint test check up api floor\n\nsetup:   ## install everything\n\tuv sync\nentire:  ## install and enable Entire, set AGENT= for other agents\n\tbash scripts/setup_entire.sh\nviews:   ## get rendered views from the GitHub Release, or use ARCHIVE=path for a local copy\nifndef ARCHIVE\n\tmkdir -p data/scene\n\tgh release download $(VIEWS_TAG) --pattern $(VIEWS_FILE) --dir data/scene --clobber\nendif\n\tuv run scripts/views_archive.py unpack $(or $(ARCHIVE),data/scene/$(VIEWS_FILE)) data/scene/equipment_room\ngpu:     ## check the GPU works\n\tuv run python -m app.gpu_check\napi:     ## backend API at http://localhost:8001/docs\n\tuv run uvicorn app.api.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8001 --reload\nfloor:   ## floor map: make floor SCENE=\"path/to/Equipment Room.ply\"\n\tuv run python -m app.nav.grid \"$(SCENE)\" --out data/scene/equipment_room/nav_grid.npz --preview runs/floor.png\ntrain:   ## train a model\n\tuv run python -m app.train\ntb:      ## training graphs at http://localhost:6006\n\tuv run tensorboard --logdir runs\nSCENE ?= data/scene/sample/scene.ply\nweb:     ## web viewer on port 8000, SCENE= picks the splat, HTTPS=1 for phone sensors\n\tuv run python web/serve.py --scene \"$(SCENE)\" $(if $(HTTPS),--https) $(if $(ASSETS),--assets \"$(ASSETS)\") $(if $(SHAPES),--shapes \"$(SHAPES)\")\nfmt:     ## tidy code style and auto-fix lint\n\tuv run --only-group dev ruff format .\n\tuv run --only-group dev ruff check --fix .\nlint:    ## check style without changing anything\n\tuv run --only-group dev ruff format --check .\n\tuv run --only-group dev ruff check .\ntest:    ## run the tests\n\tuv run pytest\ncheck: lint test  ## run before finishing work\nup:      ## train inside Docker\n\tdocker compose up --build\nViewer data from lift_v1: assets_final.json (441 objects, labels are AI-reviewed, not human-verified), assets_viewer.json (adds floor and a TEST P-005 mapping on obj-0046), shapes.json (fitted shapes)\nobjects_v1.tar 94115840\nREADME.md:27:| `make views` | Download rendered views for the scene |\ndocs/PLAN.md:326:- **Rendered views:** run `make views` (needs GitHub's `gh` CLI from cli.github.com, not the unrelated\ndocs/PLAN.md:328:  a browser and run `make views ARCHIVE=path/to/file.tar`. They go in `data/scene/equipment_room/`:\ndata/scene/x.ply\ndata/objects/x.json\n\nar project_2020113      4096 Nov  7 03:32 .\nar project_2020113      4096 Nov  7 02:53 ..\nar project_2020113 513018514 Nov  7 02:56 clean.ply\nar project_2020113  22400362 Nov  7 03:24 light_400k.ply\nar project_2020113 121733219 Nov  7 03:24 light_full.ply\nar project_2020113     19734 Nov  7 03:32 nav_grid_carved.npz\nar project_2020113     16294 Nov  7 03:24 nav_grid.npz\nar project_2020113      4096 Nov  7 02:57 render\nar project_2020113      4096 Nov  7 02:57 render_detail\nar project_2020113     36032 Nov  7 03:32 walked.npy\n\nlar project_2020113    4096 Nov  7 03:24 .\nlar project_2020113    4096 Nov  7 03:25 ..\nlar project_2020113  548586 Nov  7 03:24 assets_final.json\nlar project_2020113  373478 Nov  7 03:12 assets.json\nlar project_2020113     637 Nov  7 03:12 lift_summary.json\nlar project_2020113  238718 Nov  7 03:12 object_masks.json\nlar project_2020113  214524 Nov  7 03:24 qwen_labels.jsonl\nlar project_2020113   12037 Nov  7 03:24 shapes.json\nlar project_2020113 8695332 Nov  7 03:12 splat_labels.npy\n/dev/nvme0n1p2  468G  300G  145G  68% /\n\nr-trilar viktor-trilar    4096 Nov  7 03:35 .\nr-trilar viktor-trilar    4096 Nov  7 03:35 ..\nr-trilar viktor-trilar  548586 Nov  7 03:24 assets_final.json\nr-trilar viktor-trilar  373478 Nov  7 03:12 assets.json\nr-trilar vi