{"parentUuid":"f66c9ff0-5ed8-482d-83cb-e6b31d1b5fcb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnianJzrPUm7reKbvjfk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`make scene` now downloads the new data (154 MB, needs `gh`) and unpacks it into `data/scene/splat_v2/`. It comes from a new private Release, [`scene-v2`](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/releases/tag/scene-v2).\n\nI tested it with a fresh download: the archive matched the original byte for byte. The API then loaded all 574 objects and returned a real 6.8 m route to obj-0048. I didn't open the new scene in the viewer or run `make check`, since only the Makefile, README and handoff changed.\n\nThe command is on `viktor/viewer-objects` (`328a74e`, pushed), not `main`, so teammates need that branch or PR #3 merged first. They can also download the archive by hand and run `make scene ARCHIVE=path/to/scene_v2.tar`.\n\nAfter it finishes, it prints these two commands to start the demo:\n```\nmake web SCENE=data/scene/splat_v2/light_full.ply ASSETS=data/scene/splat_v2/assets_viewer.json SHAPES=data/scene/splat_v2/shapes.json\nSCENE_ASSETS=data/scene/splat_v2/assets_viewer.json SCENE_GRID=data/scene/splat_v2/nav_grid.npz make api\n```\n\n**What's in the download:**\n- **Scene:** your splat in full (`light_full.ply`) and lighter (`light_400k.ply`) versions\n- **Navigation:** the fixed floor map and the camera path\n- **Objects:** objects, fitted shapes and splat labels\n- **P-005:** the mapping to obj-0048, now safely in the Release, still marked as an unconfirmed pick at confidence 0.3\n\n**What's not included:**\n- **`clean.ply` (513 MB):** the full scene, which anyone rebuilding the floor map or re-running extraction would need. `splat_labels.npy` also lines up with this file, not with the light versions.\n- **Rendered views and masks:** Sasha would need these to re-run extraction on the new scene. They're on Roihu, and your cert expires today at 20:41, so tell me before then if anyone needs them added.\n\nRemember to delete this Release before the repo goes public, along with the older ones."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2576,"cache_read_input_tokens":147528,"output_tokens":749,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2576,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":749,"cache_read_input_tokens":147528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2576,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2576},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"fb63d750-d7a4-4e48-8fa1-525bb66b27a4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgniamg3RcguzjinTodVY","requestRef":"685c1d12-7016-4304-9b8a-3758fee4a040","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"633efab7-07a5-4f56-baca-1bb93174777c","timestamp":"2026-11-07T01:42:01.636Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/viewer-objects","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
