{"parentUuid":"7b1feed1-6a11-4809-a1d6-398fb6571ccc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnihC2g9W43YQoGoJgT4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Not quite: it's enough to run and test the backend, but not to rebuild the floor map.**\n\n**What he can already do with `make scene`:**\n- Run the API with real routes, using `nav_grid.npz` and `assets_viewer.json`\n- Test routes, body sizes, nearby search and moving objects against all 574 objects\n\n**What he still needs:**\n1. **The code:** `make scene`, the floor fix and `view_from` are only on `viktor/viewer-objects`. His PR #2 also adds A*, so the two need reconciling first. I recommend merging his PR, then rebasing mine on top, but that's your call.\n2. **Files to rebuild the map:** `clean.ply` (513 MB) plus the depth renders and `cameras.json` from `render` and `render_detail`. Without them he can't re-tune the map or regenerate it, and I haven't measured how big the render folders are. If he'd rather not rebuild it, the map in the download is enough. Either way, these are on Roihu, and your cert expires today at 20:41.\n\n**What to tell him:**\n- **Don't use `make floor` as it stands:** it doesn't pass `--views` or `--walked`, so on this scene it would bring back the broken map (0.2 m² connected). It also needs a labels and assets option to leave out movable objects, so I should update the target.\n- **API changes:** routes now return `view_from`, and blocked cells on the camera path are opened up in the map.\n- **Open bug in his area:** the `carrying` profile returns a 409 from the current start point, because very little floor is 0.8 m wide.\n- **Unverified:** the map assumes someone walked the camera path, and that scene units are metres.\n\n**Next steps, if you agree:** I'd add `clean.ply` and the renders as a separate optional download, such as `make scene-full`, so nobody else has to fetch them, and fix `make floor` at the same time. Do you want me to do that, and which order do you want for the PR merges?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":764,"cache_read_input_tokens":150104,"output_tokens":947,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":299},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":764,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":947,"cache_read_input_tokens":150104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":764,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":764},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"802f7f05-edc8-4f75-8182-f497b59a86dd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgnihBi5jhQvdao2KiZLJ","requestRef":"d832b27c-6d17-416a-acac-d846ca0cb66f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"5efaedd9-a91e-417f-8e2e-c2303c60bc16","timestamp":"2026-11-07T01:43:32.479Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/viewer-objects","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
