{"parentUuid":"48d7afab-2bed-44b2-8cba-7ae6415414aa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgnotjvhrq1KWKa2g2JHg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EJXNLDGAFyucsEWkMMW67j","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; cat > handoffs/viktortrilar.md <<'EOF'\n# viktortrilar: viktor/scene-full\n**Goal:** demo on own splat: real objects, floor, routes, P-005\n**Done:** PR #3 is merged by Eduard, who kept Viktor's routing and added heights. This branch adds `make scene-full`, which gets `clean.ply` (513 MB, view-dependent color) from Release `scene-v2`. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge, 9338915: don't push or merge it\n**Verified:** on main's code with `make scene` data: person route to obj-0048 6.8 m, robot 6.7 m. main's CI passes; 113 tests passed, 17 skipped locally\n**Roihu:** `data/scene/splat_v2/{clean.ply,render,render_detail}`, `runs/lift_v2`, `runs/floor_v2`. Cert valid to 2026-11-07 20:41\n**Next:** a person confirms P-005 and which of the two pumps (obj-0048 is an unconfirmed pick, confidence 0.3). Viewer doesn't draw routes yet (Benjamin's area). `make floor` doesn't pass `--views`/`--walked`. Redo the AI label review for the new scene\n**Blockers:** none. Open: whether the video was really walked, and whether units are metres. Full scene not tested on a tablet\nEOF\ngit add Makefile README.md handoffs/viktortrilar.md; git commit -qm \"Add make scene-full to download the full-quality scene\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git push -q -u git@github.com:Sairanyx/Newbies.git viktor/scene-full 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-100; gh pr create --head viktor/scene-full --base main --title \"Add make scene-full for the full-quality scene\" --body \"Adds \\`make scene-full\\`, which downloads \\`clean.ply\\` (513 MB, view-dependent color) from Release \\`scene-v2\\`, because the light scene looks rough in the viewer. Makefile, README, and handoff only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-100; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-80","description":"Update the handoff, commit, push and open the small PR","timeout":60000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2756,"cache_read_input_tokens":191052,"output_tokens":1223,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":223},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2756,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1223,"cache_read_input_tokens":191052,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2756},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":7171,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01EJXNLDGAFyucsEWkMMW67j":{"command":"cd /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies; cat > handoffs/viktortrilar.md <<'EOF'\n# viktortrilar: viktor/scene-full\n**Goal:** demo on own splat: real objects, floor, routes, P-005\n**Done:** PR #3 is merged by Eduard, who kept Viktor's routing and added heights. This branch adds `make scene-full`, which gets `clean.ply` (513 MB, view-dependent color) from Release `scene-v2`. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge, 9338915: don't push or merge it\n**Verified:** on main's code with `make scene` data: person route to obj-0048 6.8 m, robot 6.7 m. main's CI passes; 113 tests passed, 17 skipped locally\n**Roihu:** `data/scene/splat_v2/{clean.ply,render,render_detail}`, `runs/lift_v2`, `runs/floor_v2`. Cert valid to 2026-11-07 20:41\n**Next:** a person confirms P-005 and which of the two pumps (obj-0048 is an unconfirmed pick, confidence 0.3). Viewer doesn't draw routes yet (Benjamin's area). `make floor` doesn't pass `--views`/`--walked`. Redo the AI label review for the new scene\n**Blockers:** none. Open: whether the video was really walked, and whether units are metres. Full scene not tested on a tablet\nEOF\ngit add Makefile README.md handoffs/viktortrilar.md; git commit -qm \"Add make scene-full to download the full-quality scene\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git push -q -u git@github.com:Sairanyx/Newbies.git viktor/scene-full 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-100; gh pr create --head viktor/scene-full --base main --title \"Add make scene-full for the full-quality scene\" --body \"Adds \\`make scene-full\\`, which downloads \\`clean.ply\\` (513 MB, view-dependent color) from Release \\`scene-v2\\`, because the light scene looks rough in the viewer. Makefile, README, and handoff only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-100; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-80","description":"Update the handoff, commit, push and open the small PR","timeout":60000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"a4222f25-6d13-41ee-8d27-9e7333136c40","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgnotjTSGXateogC7KFVF","requestRef":"374518a0-fa96-4866-a793-5786f0af91ce","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"7610e6f8-49bc-4cb5-ba72-77bb262e06cc","timestamp":"2026-11-07T02:51:43.676Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/scene-full","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
