{"parentUuid":"8b5a4ede-13d8-4700-895f-263df4823431","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnpG3RFyRbsEhcpHWizL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The full scene isn't on the Release yet.** The download from Roihu has finished and the upload looks like it's still running, so `make scene-full` won't work until it's done.\n\n| Item | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Eduard's PR #2 | Merged by me |\n| PR #3 (viewer, routing, floor fix) | Merged by Eduard, who kept my routing and added robot and person heights |\n| PR #4 (Eduard's merge with Hannu's copilot) | Merged by Eduard; `main` passes CI and 113 local tests (17 skipped) |\n| `clean.ply` on Release `scene-v2` | Uploading; only `scene_v2.tar` is listed so far |\n| PR #6 (`make scene-full`) | Open, CI passes; I'll merge it after testing the download |\n\n**You can use these on `main` now:**\n- `make scene` for the light scene, floor map and objects\n- Real routes to obj-0048: 6.8 m for a person, 6.7 m for a robot\n\n**Unused commit:** my merge commit `9338915` on my local `viktor/viewer-objects` branch is now redundant, because Eduard resolved the same conflict the other way. It's also on the remote branch, but not in `main`. Nobody should merge that branch again, because it would undo his work.\n\n**About the viewer quality:** `clean.ply` has the same splats as `light_full.ply`, plus view-dependent colour. It should look better, but it won't remove the black holes, floaters or blur from close up, because those are in the splat itself. It's also too big to rely on for the tablet, and I haven't tested it in the viewer yet. Try it on the 5090 first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":408,"cache_read_input_tokens":195123,"output_tokens":579,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":27},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"