{"parentUuid":"15049e29-b2d3-47fc-a0bd-6d6631a7521a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgnpfh8Ya1yB2ozjNPfWC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The full `clean.ply` is on the `scene-v2` Release, but `make scene-full` isn't on `main` yet because PR #6 still needs merging.** The permission system blocked me from merging it without a review, so that's left to you or a teammate. It only changes the Makefile, README and handoff, and CI passes.\n\n- **Merge:** [PR #6](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/6), or run `gh pr merge 6 --merge`.\n- **Upload:** the 513 MB file's checksum on GitHub matches Roihu's copy exactly.\n- **Not tested:** `make scene-full` hasn't completed a real download, because that test was the run that got stopped. A dry run shows the right commands. I also haven't opened `clean.ply` in the viewer.\n\nUntil it's merged, you can get the full scene directly:\n```\ngh release download scene-v2 --pattern clean.ply --dir data/scene/splat_v2 --clobber\nmake web SCENE=data/scene/splat_v2/clean.ply ASSETS=data/scene/splat_v2/assets_viewer.json SHAPES=data/scene/splat_v2/shapes.json\n```\nYour local `clean.ply` is already in `data/scene/splat_v2/`, so on this machine you can skip the download and just run `make web`. This ThinkPad has no NVIDIA GPU, so judge the look on the 5090."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":199144,"output_tokens":473,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":416,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":473,"cache_read_input_tokens":199144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":416,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ep