{"parentUuid":"59736144-0e0b-4739-abb0-88679ec96ffd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnpnunVGcLYjG2mAk34c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #6 is merged, so `make scene-full` is now on `main` (`930488e`). The branch had conflicted with Eduard's PR #7 on one line of the Makefile, so I kept both sets of targets; his `make db` is still there, and CI passed before the merge.\n\nTo get the full scene, teammates run:\n```\ngit pull\nmake scene        # floor map, objects and light scene\nmake scene-full   # adds clean.ply (513 MB)\nmake web SCENE=data/scene/splat_v2/clean.ply ASSETS=data/scene/splat_v2/assets_viewer.json SHAPES=data/scene/splat_v2/shapes.json\n```\n\n**Still untested:**\n- **`make scene-full`:** it hasn't completed a real download, though the uploaded file's checksum matches Roihu's copy.\n- **`clean.ply` in the viewer:** I haven't opened it, so try it on the 5090 first.\n\n**Next up:**\n- **P-005:** someone needs to confirm which pump it is.\n- **Viewer:** it still doesn't draw routes, last I checked, and it's the biggest demo gap. Benjamin should confirm whether he's on it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":787,"cache_read_input_tokens":201852,"output_tokens":390,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":787,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":390,"cache_read_input_tokens":201852,"cache_creation_input_tokens":787,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":787},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"97a68c8b-c0