{"parentUuid":"ac285cb6-b7f7-4478-80fe-ccaf3a74fa5f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnptcYpa4YaTpWy5f2x7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"My pick is **drawing routes in the viewer**, then **an end-to-end demo run**. Navigation is 25% of the score, and the demo depends on a route you can actually see. Here's everything I'd do, in priority order:\n\n| # | Work | Why it matters | Owner | Size |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **Draw routes in the viewer:** show the route line, walk along it, and finish at `view_from` looking at the pump | Navigation 25%, demo 10%. The API works, but last I checked the viewer doesn't show routes | Benjamin's area, so check with him first | Small |\n| 2 | **Full demo run:** ask about P-005, get the copilot's diagnosis, follow the route to the pump, on the 5090 and a tablet with no internet | Nothing has been tested as one flow, so this is where hidden failures will show up | Everyone, I can start it | Small to medium |\n| 3 | **Better labels on the new scene:** redo the AI review of all 574 objects, with pump and valve checks using reference crops | Extraction is 30%, the largest share. 461 objects still just show as \"object\", and many pump labels are wrong | Me and Sasha | Medium |\n| 4 | **Cleaner scene for the viewer:** use the same carving to remove floaters at all heights, not only body height | Directly tackles the \"looks somewhat bad\" problem, and the method already exists | Me | Small |\n| 5 | **Fitted shapes and objects:** merge duplicate pieces, group pipe runs, and split the front pump out of obj-0001 | Extraction 30%. It also lets you map the right pump if P-005 turns out to be the front one | Me and Sasha | Medium |\n| 6 | **Tidying up:** fix `make floor`, fill in the scene comparison in `docs/RESULTS.md`, and connect viewer drags to `/api/changes` | Stops the broken floor map coming back, and gives the slides real numbers | Me and Eduard | Small |\n\n**Questions only people can answer:**\n- Which pump is P-005? Valmet's engineer is the best person to ask.\n- Was the video actually walked? The floor map assumes it was.\n- Is the Sunday 09:00 submission time correct? It comes from Eduard's doc and hasn't been confirmed.\n\n**Roihu deadline:** your cert expires today at 20:41, and items 3–5 all need Roihu, so renew it or do that work before then.\n\nIf Benjamin is free, I'd start on 4 now, because it's quick and improves every demo view, then move to 3. If he isn't, I'd take 1 first. Which do you want?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_read_input_tokens":202639,"output_tokens":1258,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":383},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1258,"cache_read_input_tokens":202639,"cache_creation_input_tokens":397,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":397},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e121d684-6e63-4f2a-ba37-2c053163eed2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgnptcEEGC1DaZ59o6Aah","requestRef":"c98e7bf3-f22e-40f6-aa86-1269d6a607bf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"6fa4ebb2-f70f-475e-a2aa-86aac5cc44e6","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:04:51.434Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/scene-full","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
