l.jpg`. Cleaned current scene: `data/scene/splat_v2/tidy.ply`. Cert valid to 2026-11-07 20:41\n**Next:** look at compare_all.jpg, then Viktor decides which scene to demo. Returning to Valmet's means lift_v1 objects (441, AI-reviewed labels) and a new P-005 pick. Update docs/RESULTS.md, which still says own splat is clearly better\n**Blockers:** none. P-005 on obj-0048 is still an unconfirmed pick, on the own-splat objects only\nEOF\ngit add handoffs/viktortrilar.md app/scene/tidy.py app/scene/train_splat.py tests/test_scene_tidy.py tests/test_train_splat.py web/main.js; git commit -qm \"Add a viewer cleanup tool and splat training options, and lower the eye height\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-90; git status --short | head -3","description":"Update the handoff and commit it with the work so far"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d731eddc-8902-4b3b-a41a-807c7b8e5c5c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgnqsdG4xyrBKqeZsQMh1","requestRef":"f9ddc8d6-d48d-4771-b93f-4fe49d769311","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"4fbf20b2-66cb-487a-a134-603309b87be4","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:17:39.097Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/scene-look","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
