{"parentUuid":"a448a988-8d72-4b63-bffb-8ee632a95136","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgnr3RJm4eeBwbXDBhhqw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Yes, it's on Roihu:** `/scratch/project_2020113/sinceai/data/scene/equipment_room/clean.ply`, 278 MB and 1,178,554 splats. It's Valmet's `Equipment Room.ply` with near-invisible splats and floaters removed, keeping the view-dependent colour. It's also the file used in the side-by-side I just showed you.\n\nIt isn't on any `make` download. `make scene` and `make scene-full` only fetch our splat, and I don't think the older `objects-v1` Release has it either; as far as I remember it only has the light versions, but my check of that archive's contents didn't complete. Your repo-root `Equipment Room.ply` is the original, uncleaned file, and it should still look much the same if you want to try it in a viewer now.\n\nIf you want, I can add Valmet's clean version to a Release with its own make command, such as `make scene-valmet`, which would take a few minutes. It's Valmet's own data, but it would sit in the same private Release setup as our other scene files. I'd hold off until the comparison finishes in case it changes which scene we demo, unless you want it now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":637,"cache_read_input_tokens":242726,"output_tokens":460,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":87},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":637,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":460,"cache_read_input_tokens":242726,"cache_creation_input_tokens":637,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":637},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null