{"parentUuid":"7ed6762e-b7b7-4f17-9490-2f9da2e7a4e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnrcZaWfGxmAK5bDQVvR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The retrain is still running, and I have no new findings on Valmet's splat yet.** My exploration run didn't get to do anything, because you stopped it while it was waiting for a GPU.\n\n| Item | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Retrain (job 2926105) | Running, 15,000 of 30,000 steps done at last log, at 25.74 dB on 20 held-out frames; the previous run's final score was 26.41 dB on all 187, so that's not a like-for-like comparison yet. About 10 more minutes |\n| Three-way comparison (job 2926124) | Waiting for the retrain to finish |\n| Valmet exploration (job 2926231) | Still queued on Roihu after you stopped the call, held by the GPU limit. It may start when a GPU frees up |\n| Code | Committed locally on `viktor/scene-look` (`6148efa`), not pushed |\n\n**What I know about Valmet's splat so far:**\n- **It looks much better:** in the same-viewpoint renders it's far more complete, especially the floor and ceiling, and holds up away from the filmed path.\n- **It's built differently:** no needle splats (it seems to cap at about 10:1), over twice the share of splats on the floor, and softer, more blended splats.\n- **Still open:** how it was made, and whether it's the same capture as our video. That chair may mean it isn't.\n- **What that means for the scene switch:** my 26.57 vs 11.82 dB result may be unfair to Valmet, and it isn't a good reason to stay on our splat. `docs/RESULTS.md` still says ours is \"clearly better\", which I need to correct.\n\nYou've stopped that command twice, so tell me if something about it was wrong, such as the GPU use or how long it blocks. Otherwise, how do you want to continue?\n1. **Let the queued job run (my recommendation):** it starts when a GPU frees up, and I'll report what it finds. It would compete with the comparison job for that GPU, though I can't say which would go first.\n2. **Cancel it:** I'd only look at the file and Valmet's documents, which needs no GPU, and leave the renders until later."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_read_input_tokens":248751,"output_tokens":851,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":148},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":248751,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a1bec700-82dd-4202-8128-15852fca08a1","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgnrcZHesmcXsEUjath7L","requestRef":"d3680594-88c0-4031-b599-1405624961a3","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"048670d3-8937-4fed-90de-3075a0cc8427","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:27:22.980Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/scene-look","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
