{"parentUuid":"030c3782-8fda-4046-b6a2-00817934de66","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"176ca781-b6b2-4d0e-ad83-ab1a206bd4ae","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014WMhyg4Yyay6Wz26Nq1Q7S","type":"tool_result","content":"3:    uv run --no-project --with numpy python -m app.scene.load INPUT.ply --out clean.ply\n177:def main() -> None:\n179:    parser.add_argument(\"input\", type=Path)\n180:    parser.add_argument(\"--out\", type=Path, help=\"write the cleaned scene here\")\n181:    parser.add_argument(\"--up\", type=float, nargs=3, default=(0.0, -1.0, 0.0))\n182:    parser.add_argument(\"--min-opacity\", type=float, default=0.05)\n199:if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n\"\"\"Read, validate, clean, and write Gaussian splat PLY files.\n\n    uv run --no-project --with numpy python -m app.scene.load INPUT.ply --out clean.ply\n\nWorks with any scene: properties are found by name, not position, and the floor search takes the\nscene's up direction. `Equipment Room.ply` has +y pointing down, so its up direction is (0, -1, 0).\n\"\"\"\n\nMakefile:7:SCENE_FULL ?= clean.ply","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bfcb5b2f-4560-42c2-b529-818516bf5db3","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:37:20.662Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"3:    uv run --no-project --with numpy python -m app.scene.load INPUT.ply --out clean.ply\n177:def main() -> None:\n179:    parser.add_argument(\"input\", type=Path)\n180:    parser.add_argument(\"--out\", type=Path, help=\"write the cleaned scene here\")\n181:    parser.add_argument(\"--up\", type=float, nargs=3, default=(0.0, -1.0, 0.0))\n182:    parser.add_argument(\"--min-opacity\", type=float, default=0.05)\n199:if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n\"\"\"Read, validate, clean, and write Gaussian splat PLY files.\n\n    uv run --no-project --with numpy python -m app.scene.load INPUT.ply --out clean.ply\n\nWorks with any scene: properties are found by name, not position, and the floor search takes the\nscene's up direction. `Equipment Room.ply` has +y pointing down, so its up direction is (0, -1, 0).\n\"\"\"\n\nMakefile:7:SCENE_FULL ?= clean.ply","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5b7eeaa2-c2b2-41a8-95cc-7f72bd7a58cf","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","root":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","branch":"viktor/scene-look","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Sairanyx/Newbies","visibility":"unknown"}]}},"live_cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","platform":"linux"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"030c3782-8fda-4046-b6a2-00817934de66","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/scene-look","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","id":"e6a915e8-2b9e-42be-a066-2c34a7f622eb","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:37:20.737Z","version":"2.1.319","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"588ed1bb5cde13c6dac969a3082db367af247bea954d4545a2562540030824a9","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"20438ba4-6693-4f1b-b310-bd4be3cc0486","keep":177,"tail":["f5f27ced09775a6d0a6af034b6bc7ad6cd4f7fe18df657e5cafe66c86acb8231","ba9e58c8f35cb45c309a2d77ef99fd36a710491daaa3ddafc6494c89557b8b0b"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",178,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"8c1b2821683fa493ff3a659b5eb12c1c09ef82cd998559f2ec9254963654bb78"}
{"parentUuid":"bfcb5b2f-4560-42c2-b529-818516bf5db3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgnsPJuEEHHCyeVM72Djw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The easiest way today is for each teammate to generate it themselves in a few seconds, if they have `Equipment Room.ply`.** It's Valmet's file, kept out of git, so they need a copy from wherever you shared it, such as the Drive folder.\n\n```\nuv run --no-project --with numpy python -m app.scene.load \"Equipment Room.ply\" --out data/scene/equipment_room/clean.ply\n```\nThen, to view it:\n```\nmake web SCENE=data/scene/equipment_room/clean.ply\n```\nAdd `?lod=0&res=2` to the viewer URL for the sharpest image.\n\nThis should give the same scene as Roihu's copy, because it uses the same cleaning code, and it took about 4 seconds on a ThinkPad last time. I haven't compared the output against Roihu's file. The file is 278 MB and shouldn't be committed to git.\n\n**Other ways to get it:**\n- **From Roihu:** anyone with project access can copy `/scratch/project_2020113/sinceai/data/scene/equipment_room/clean.ply`.\n- **From a `make` command (my recommendation if we switch back):** I'd add it to a private Release with its objects, labels, shapes and a new floor map, so `make scene-valmet` gets everything at once. That's Valmet's own data going into the private repo's Releases, so it would need deleting before the repo goes public, like the others.\n\nDo you want me to publish that now? Otherwise I'll do it as part of the switch once the alignment check is back. The floor map isn't built yet, so publishing now would only cover the scene, objects, labels and shapes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":806,"cache_read_input_tokens":258245,"output_tokens":532,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":806,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":532,"cache_read_input_tokens":258245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":806,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":806},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"09dbf010-59b0-4718-ab22-8000a061521a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgnsPJWADBr2s76Y5z8Nf","requestRef":"e6a915e8-2b9e-42be-a066-2c34a7f622eb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"697bed5b-9dbd-4453-83bd-66734d91c73f","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:37:26.491Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/scene-look","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
