(.title) | \\(.mergedAt) | \\(.author.login)\\n\\(.body)\"' | cut -c1-900; git log -8 --format='%h %an %s' origin/main | cut -c1-90; git show --stat --format= 637ea94 -m --first-parent | tail -14 | cut -c1-80; cat handoffs/eduard-rednic.md | cut -c1-420; git diff 930488e origin/main --stat -- Makefile app/scene app/nav/grid.py | tail -6 | cut -c1-80; grep -n \"^[a-z-]*scene[a-z-]*:\\|SCENE_TAG\\|SCENE_DIR ?=\\|original\" Makefile | cut -c1-130; gh release list --limit 6 | cut -c1-60; sed -n 60,75p tests/test_scene_load.py | cut -c1-90","description":"Read Eduard's new PR and what changed on main","timeout":30000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"6c2020a8-75ab-4a5e-9322-e42e97b0b4c7","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgntB24EqjQrAm9ZDzEiv","requestRef":"fdcae521-9de0-4eee-a4af-5a8b40fd8c9b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"577e0bcb-21a7-4e9c-9bc0-7d34a4d1837a","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:47:48.816Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/scene-look","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
{"parentUuid":"577e0bcb-21a7-4e9c-9bc0-7d34a4d1837a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e3627da8-bb68-4946-8d13-ba6a2f2782cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016BZ66hwePU27TkiAqLHD1B","type":"tool_result","content":"Use the original Equipment Room scene, and link all records on it | 2026-11-07T03:46:55Z | Sairanyx\nSwitches the demo to the original `Equipment Room.ply`, because our own splat has holes in the floor.\n\n**Defaults changed:**\n- `SCENE_DIR` is now `data/scene/equipment_room`, and `make scene` gets Release `objects-v1` (441 objects).\n- `make floor` uses the original scene and leaves movable objects out of the map. Views are optional.\n- `make api` loads this scene by default, and `/api/assets` returns `start`.\n- `make scene-full` still gets our own splat, into `splat_v2`.\n\n**Setup:** run `make scene`, put `Equipment Room.ply` in `data/scene/equipment_room/` and the Excel pack in `data/`, then `make floor mapping db api`.\n\n**Mapping:** objects within 1 m are preferred, then up to 2 m, so all 30 Excel records link: 10 by class, 19 by similar class and 1 by hand. They're marked as procedural.\n\n**Verified:** `make check` passes, and `make nav-check` passes 12 of 12. Live on this scene: person route to `obj-0046` 3.17 m, stops 1.25 m away; robot 4.11 m, stops 0.16 m away. 24 linked objects are within 3 m of the route.\n\n**Please note:**\n- Object IDs differ from `splat_v2`, so the viewer needs `assets_mapped.json` from this scene.\n- `obj-0046` is a test pick for `P-005`, and needs a person to confirm it.\n- `start` is the scene's default `[0, 1.178, 0]`, not a real entrance.\n\n637ea94 Eduard Rednic Merge pull request #9 from Sairanyx/eduard-original-scene\n441bda0 Eduard Rednic Use the original Equipment Room scene, and link all records on it\na4bcc73 Eduard Rednic Merge pull request #8 from Sairanyx/eduard-nav-tools\ned19db3 Eduard Rednic Add nav-check, keep floater removal in make floor, and survive datab\n930488e Viktor Trilar Merge pull request #6 from Sairanyx/viktor/scene-full\neac344a viktortrilar Merge main into viktor/scene-full\n5113d1f Eduard Rednic Merge pull request #7 from Sairanyx/eduard-timescale\n9a2c44d Eduard Rednic Add local TimescaleDB for telemetry and scene changes\n Makefile                      | 29 +++++++++++++---------------\n app/copilot/mapping.py        | 45 ++++++++++++++++++++-----------------------\n app/nav/check.py              |  6 ++++--\n app/nav/grid.py               |  5 ++++-\n docs/PLAN.md                  |  2 +-\n docs/RESULTS.md               |  1 +\n handoffs/eduard-rednic.md     | 12 ++++++------\n tests/test_copilot_mapping.py | 12 +++++++++++-\n 8 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 51 deletions(-)\n# eduard-rednic: eduard-original-scene\n**Goal:** floor, routing, nearby search and backend API (`app/nav/`, `app/api/`), per docs/PLAN.md.\n**Done:** switched the defaults to the original `Equipment Room.ply`, as ours has holes in the floor. `make scene` gets `objects-v1`; then `make floor mapping db api`. `/api/assets` returns `start`. All 30 Excel records link to objects.\n**Verified:** `make check` passes; `make nav-check` 12 of 12; live API on the scene. Target is `obj-0046`, person route 3.17 m, stops 1.25 m away.\n**Next:** check the route in the 3D scene once Benjamin draws it; rehearse on the 5090 offline. Later, when asked: telemetry simulator.\n**Team:** viewer should use `data/scene/equipment_room/light_full.ply` and `assets_mapped.json`, which now has different object IDs from `splat_v2`.\n**Blockers:** none. Open: `obj-0046` is a test pick for `P-005`, and needs a person to confirm it; the `start` point `[0, 1.178, 0]` is only the scene's default.\n Makefile        | 29 ++++++++++++++++-------------\n app/nav/grid.py |  5 ++++-\n 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)\n5:SCENE_TAG ?= objects-v1\n7:SCENE_DIR ?= data/scene/equipment_room\n22:scene:   ## get the original scene's objects and light splats from the GitHub Release, or use ARCHIVE=path\n25:\tgh release download $(SCENE_TAG) --pattern $(SCENE_FILE) --dir data/scene --clobber\n31:scene-full: ## get our own full-quality splat (513 MB). The demo uses the original scene instead\nDemo scene v2 (own splat)\tLatest\tscene-v2\t2026-11-07T01:41:1\nEquipment Room objects v1\t\tobjects-v1\t2026-11-07T00:32:38Z\nEquipment Room views v1\t\tviews-v1\t2026-11-06T22:31:48Z\ndef test_valid_mask_catches_corrupted_records():\n    splats = make_splats(4)\n    splats.data[\"x\"][1] = np.nan\n    splats.data[\"opacity\"][2] = 1e36\n    assert valid_mask(splats).tolist() == [True, False, False, True]\n\n\ndef test_clean_mask_removes_transparent_oversized_and_isolated_splats():\n    splats = make_splats(400)\n    splats.data[\"opacity\"][0] = -10.0\n    splats.data[\"scale_0\"][1] = 5.0\n    splats.data[\"x\"][2] = 50.0\n    keep = clean_mask(splats)\n    assert not keep[:3].any()\n    assert keep[3:].mean() > 0.9","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1c7063b0-cc15-4e3a-a1c4-dd5fd709321a","timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:47:50.634Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Use the original Equipment Room scene, and link all records on it | 2026-11-07T03:46:55Z | Sairanyx\nSwitches the demo to the original `Equipment Room.ply`, because our own splat has holes in the floor.\n\n**Defaults changed:**\n- `SCENE_DIR` is now `data/scene/equipment_room`, and `make scene` gets Release `objects-v1` (441 objects).\n- `make floor` uses the original scene and leaves movable objects out of the map. Views are optional.\n- `make api` loads this scene by default, and `/api/assets` returns `start`.\n- `make scene-full` still gets our own splat, into `splat_v2`.\n\n**Setup:** run `make scene`, put `Equipment Room.ply` in `data/scene/equipment_room/` and the Excel pack in `data/`, then `make floor mapping db api`.\n\n**Mapping:** objects within 1 m are preferred, then up to 2 m, so all 30 Excel records link: 10 by class, 19 by similar class and 1 by hand. They're marked as procedural.\n\n**Verified:** `make check` passes, and `make nav-check` passes 12 of 12. Live on this scene: person route to `obj-0046` 3.17 m, stops 1.25 m away; robot 4.11 m, stops 0.16 m away. 24 linked objects are within 3 m of the route.\n\n**Please note:**\n- Object IDs differ from `splat_v2`, so the viewer needs `assets_mapped.json` from this scene.\n- `obj-0046` is a test pick for `P-005`, and needs a person to confirm it.\n- `start` is the scene's default `[0, 1.178, 0]`, not a real entrance.\n\n637ea94 Eduard Rednic Merge pull request #9 from Sairanyx/eduard-original-scene\n441bda0 Eduard Rednic Use the original Equipment Room scene, and link all records on it\na4bcc73 Eduard Rednic Merge pull request #8 from Sairanyx/eduard-nav-tools\ned19db3 Eduard Rednic Add nav-check, keep floater removal in make floor, and survive datab\n930488e Viktor Trilar Merge pull request #6 from Sairanyx/viktor/scene-full\neac344a viktortrilar Merge main into viktor/scene-full\n5113d1f Eduard Rednic Merge pull request #7 from Sairanyx/eduard-timescale\n9a2c44d Eduard Rednic Add local TimescaleDB for telemetry and scene changes\n Makefile                      | 29 +++++++++++++---------------\n app/copilot/mapping.py        | 45 ++++++++++++++++++++-----------------------\n app/nav/check.py              |  6 ++++--\n app/nav/grid.py               |  5 ++++-\n docs/PLAN.md                  |  2 +-\n docs/RESULTS.md               |  1 +\n handoffs/eduard-rednic.md     | 12 ++++++------\n tests/test_copilot_mapping.py | 12 +++++++++++-\n 8 files changed, 61 insertions(+), 51 deletions(-)\n# eduard-rednic: eduard-original-scene\n**Goal:** floor, routing, nearby search and backend API (`app/nav/`, `app/api/`), per docs/PLAN.md.\n**Done:** switched the defaults to the original `Equipment Room.ply`, as ours has holes in the floor. `make scene` gets `objects-v1`; then `make floor mapping db api`. `/api/assets` returns `start`. All 30 Excel records link to objects.\n**Verified:** `make check` passes; `make nav-check` 12 of 12; live API on the scene. Target is `obj-0046`, person route 3.17 m, stops 1.25 m away.\n**Next:** check the route in the 3D scene once Benjamin draws it; rehearse on the 5090 offline. Later, when asked: telemetry simulator.\n**Team:** viewer should use `data/scene/equipment_room/light_full.ply` and `assets_mapped.json`, which now has different object IDs from `splat_v2`.\n**Blockers:** none. Open: `obj-0046` is a test pick for `P-005`, and needs a person to confirm it; the `start` point `[0, 1.178, 0]` is only the scene's default.\n Makefile        | 29 ++++++++++++++++-------------\n app/nav/grid.py |  5 ++++-\n 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)\n5:SCENE_TAG ?= objects-v1\n7:SCENE_DIR ?= data/scene/equipment_room\n22:scene:   ## get the original scene's objects and light splats from the GitHub Release, or use ARCHIVE=path\n25:\tgh release download $(SCENE_TAG) --pattern $(SCENE_FILE) --dir data/scene --clobber\n31:scene-full: ## get our own full-quality splat (513 MB). The demo uses the original scene instead\nDemo scene v2 (own splat)\tLatest\tscene-v2\t2026-11-07T01:41:1\nEquipment Room objects v1\t\tobjects-v1\t2026-11-07T00:32:38Z\nEquipment Room views v1\t\tviews-v1\t2026-11-06T22:31:48Z\ndef test_valid_mask_catches_corrupted_records():\n    splats = make_splats(4)\n    splats.data[\"x\"][1] = np.nan\n    splats.data[\"opacity\"][2] = 1e36\n    assert valid_mask(splats).tolist() == [True, False, False, True]\n\n\ndef test_clean_mask_removes_transparent_oversized_and_isolated_splats():\n    splats = make_splats(400)\n    splats.data[\"opacity\"][0] = -10.0\n    splats.data[\"scale_0\"][1] = 5.0\n    splats.data[\"x\"][2] = 50.0\n    keep = clean_mask(splats)\n    assert not keep[:3].any()\n    assert keep[3:].mean() > 0.9","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"6c2020a8-75ab-4a5e-9322-e42e97b0b4c7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/home/viktor